<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>GlassFolders</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>GlassFolders 0.7.4 Beta 2.2</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Beta 2.2：第一步把关闭状态 Liquid Glass 精确退回之前验证过的浅色基线，并移除后来加入的 _updateVisualStyle 主动激活；第二步按参考图重做 Clear 打开态：只使用壁纸来源的浅层模糊与中性白高光，深色/浅色模式分别调节，不添加紫/蓝/粉等彩色 tint；第三步把 Liquid Glass 打开态的“上→左上→左侧渐隐”和“下→右下→右侧渐隐”改成严格对称的连续高光轨道，连接点不参与衰减。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>风格</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Clear：使用独立的浅层 backdrop blur，颜色完全来自壁纸；深色模式增加少量中性亮度/白色高光，浅色模式降低这些中性光学量，避免乳白。Liquid Glass：保持更厚的 blur / saturation 与更强白色镜面高光。两种风格均不添加紫、蓝、粉等彩色 tint。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Style</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>Clear</string>
				<string>Liquid Glass</string>
			</array>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>1</integer>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>玻璃强度</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>每 5% 一个档位。百分比同时控制打开与关闭文件夹的玻璃响应和白色镜面高光；Clear 与 Liquid Glass 使用不同曲线。建议先以 55% 作为基准，再按壁纸明暗微调。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>cellClass</key>
			<string>GFPercentSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>GlassStrength</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>55</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>100</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>关闭文件夹的 Liquid Glass 仍可创建独立的 SBHLibraryCategoryPodBackgroundView 作为被动视觉层，但 Beta 2.2 不再主动调用其 _updateVisualStyle；这样精确恢复之前验证过的浅色关闭态，避免系统 material 再次叠深。真实 App 资源库本身不会被 hook 或修改。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>应用并注销</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>respring</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>关于</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSTitleValueCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>作者</string>
			<key>get</key>
			<string>authorValue:</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
